[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4385.83, "timestamp": "01:13:05", "text": "呃，精灵或半身人。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4387.02, "timestamp": "01:13:07", "text": "深渊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4389.91, "timestamp": "01:13:09", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4392.709, "timestamp": "01:13:12", "text": "所以，等等。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4395.669, "timestamp": "01:13:15", "text": "语言对你有什么帮助？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4399.83, "timestamp": "01:13:19", "text": "呃，不多。它很像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4401.27, "timestamp": "01:13:21", "text": "角色扮演相关内容。它并没有真正到来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4404.47, "timestamp": "01:13:24", "text": "太多了。再说一遍，至少在我的风格里是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4406.07, "timestamp": "01:13:26", "text": "就像私信别人一样，它其实并不那么容易实现。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4410.63, "timestamp": "01:13:30", "text": "太多了。这种情况非常罕见"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4413.16, "timestamp": "01:13:33", "text": "嗯，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4414.709, "timestamp": "01:13:34", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4416.63, "timestamp": "01:13:36", "text": "就是那种感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4420.07, "timestamp": "01:13:40", "text": "它只存在于游戏中，但我真的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4425.11, "timestamp": "01:13:45", "text": "我其实不太常用它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4427.75, "timestamp": "01:13:47", "text": "等等，既然我是星界精灵，那我岂不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4430.229, "timestamp": "01:13:50", "text": "你已经懂精灵语了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4433.27, "timestamp": "01:13:53", "text": "呃，你其实并不喜欢这样，这很友善。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4435.91, "timestamp": "01:13:55", "text": "很有趣。精灵天生并不知道"}]